#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 14
#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Whitelist of allowed runners."
msgstr "Göödlist mit tolaten Dregers"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 15
#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "If set, this list defines which runners will be used at runtime."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, leggt disse List de Dregers fast, de Du bruken wullt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 20
#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "History if past queries succesfully completed"
msgstr "Vörgeschicht vun de Anfragen mit Spood"

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 26
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Maximum number of query matching threads able run simultaneously."
msgstr "Hööchsttall vun Anfraag-Utföhrsträng, de blangenanner lopen dörvt"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 27
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"The number of threads used scales with the number of processors. This entry "
"allows you to define a hard upper limit independant of the number of "
"processors."
msgstr ""
"De Tall vun bruukt Utföhrsträng wasst mit de Perzessertall. Mit disse "
"Optschoon kannst Du en Hööchsttall fastleggen, de nich vun de Tall vun "
"Perzessern afhangt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file krunner.kcfg line 35
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Whether to keep the tasks dialog above other windows when shown."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat de Opgavendialoog vör anner Finster blifft, wenn he wiest "
"warrt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 11
#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "Enable screen saver"
msgstr "Pausschirm anmaken"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 12
#: rc.cpp:34
msgid "Enables the screen saver."
msgstr "Maakt den Pausschirm an."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 16
#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "Screen saver timeout"
msgstr "Tietgrenz för Pausschirm"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 17
#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Sets the seconds after which the screen saver is started."
msgstr "Leggt fast, na woveel Sekunnen de Pausschirm anmaakt warrt."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 21
#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Suspend screen saver when DPMS kicks in"
msgstr "Pausschirm utsetten, wenn de Stroomkuntrull anfangt"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kscreensaversettings.kcfg line 24
#: rc.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Usually the screen saver is suspended when display power saving kicks in,\n"
"       as nothing can be seen on the screen anyway, obviously. However, some "
"screen savers\n"
"       actually perform useful computations, so it is not desirable to "
"suspend them."
msgstr ""
"Normalerwies sett de Pausschirm ut, wenn de Stroomspoorfunkschoon vun\n"
"den Schirm dat Leid kriggt, dor gifft dat jo denn man so un so nix mehr to "
"kieken.\n"
"Man dat gifft ok Pausschirmen, de wat utreekt, wat Een later noch bruken "
"will -\n"
"denn is dat Utsetten nich so goot."

